---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sacred Ink Academy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Sacred Ink Academy."
  path="/en/privacy/"
  lang="en"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section page-hero" style="padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal information</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top:16px; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-body content-block" id="cookies">
      <div class="stub-note" style="margin-top:0;">This is a Privacy Policy template. Replace it with a legally reviewed version before launch — including real company details, DPO contact (if applicable), and a list of data processors (CRM, email platform, analytics, Contentful).</div>
      <h2>What data we collect</h2>
      <p>Name, email, contact details (phone/Telegram), and technical usage data (referring page, UTM tags) — when you sign up for the test drive, submit an application, or subscribe for a discount.</p>
      <h2>How we use your data</h2>
      <p>To send you the material we promised (promo code, test-drive access), respond to your request, and, with your consent, send you information about Sacred Ink Academy training.</p>
      <h2>Cookie Policy</h2>
      <p>The site uses technical cookies for it to function correctly (for example, so the discount popup isn't shown again) and may use analytics cookies (Google Analytics) to improve the site.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request deletion of your data or unsubscribe from our mailing list at any time by writing to our contact email.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
